  (text "POWER MANAGEMENT\nInput: USB 5V (100W PD capable)\nOutput: 1.8V (FPGA Core)\n        3.3V (FPGA I/O, TIA, Modulator)\n        12V (Fan PWM)\n\nBuck Converters:\n- XC9241B (5V to 1.8V, 30A)\n- XC9242B (5V to 3.3V, 20A)\n" (at 40.64 100.33 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.254))))

  (text "FPGA: Xilinx Kintex-7 XC7K420T-2FFG676C\n- 420,000 logic cells\n- 1,430 18Kb BRAM\n- 840 DSP48E1 slices\n- BGA 676-pin (27×27mm)\n- Power: 1.8V Core + 3.3V I/O\n" (at 40.64 127 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.254))))

  (text "USB INTERFACE\nController: USB 2.0 Device\nConnector: USB-C Receptacle\nData Rate: 480 Mbps (High-Speed)\nPower Delivery: Up to 100W\n" (at 100.33 100.33 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.254))))

  (text "THERMAL MANAGEMENT\n- Copper-Invar baseplate (2mm)\n- Thermal vias (0.3mm, 120-unit array)\n- Graphite thermal pads (3 W/m·K)\n- 40mm axial fan (Noctua)\n- Temperature sensor (TMP36)\n- Fan PWM control from FPGA\n" (at 40.64 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.254))))

  (text "OPTICAL INTERFACE (8 Channels)\nInput:  TIA (Transimpedance Amplifier)\n        - Photodiode receiver\n        - Gain: 100kV/A\n        - Bandwidth: 1 GHz\n        - Component: TIA_AMP (Custom or OPA2356)\n\nOutput: Optical Modulator Driver\n        - Mach-Zehnder modulator\n        - Voltage swing: 0-3.3V\n        - Bandwidth: 1 GHz\n" (at 100.33 127 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.254))))

  (text "NEURON ARRAY (8 Spiking Neurons)\nImplemented in FPGA fabric:\n- Leaky Integrate-and-Fire (LIF) model\n- Configurable threshold (0-65535)\n- Refractory period: Programmable\n- Spike output: Digital (1-bit per neuron)\n- Clock: 250 MHz internal FPGA clock\n" (at 100.33 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.254))))

